:: Seaspray Hotel Dog
<<effects>>

You enter the room. The <<person>> releases the source of the barking:
<<saveNPC 0 "hotel_dog">>
<<endevent>>
<<beastNEWinit 1 "dog">>
a <<beasttype>>.
<br><br>

Freed from <<bhis>> prison, <<bhe>> runs a lap around your legs, then bolts around the room. "I'll need to take a dump," the dog's owner says before heading into the bathroom. "Do help yourself!" the owner shouts from inside.
<br><br>

You right a fallen table, restore a lamp to its position, test it, then begin to pick up the shredded upholstery. The sofa is soiled, but you can make the room presentable.
<br><br>

<<set $danger to random(1, 10000)>><<set $dangerevent to 0>>
<<if ($danger gte (9900 - $allure) or $eventforced) and $eventskip is 0>>
    <<if (isBestialityOnForAnyCreature() or $monster is 1) and !$NPCList[0].lewdBlocked>>
        You fill a bin bag with shredded papers, then drop to the floor to clear beneath the sofa. It's raised above the ground just enough to fit.
        <br><br>
        당신이 허리 위까지 파묻혔을 때, 무언가 당신의 은밀한 곳을 쿡 찌르는 것이 느껴진다. <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신에게 올라탄다.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel Dog Rape]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<else>>
        쓰레기봉투 두어 개를 채우고 나니 방이 깨끗해졌다. 하지만 떠나려고 돌아섰을 때, <<beasttype>>【이가】 당신을 마주 보고 있는 것을 발견한다. <<bHe>>【은는】 으르렁거리더니, <span class="pink">당신에게 달려든다.</span>
        <br><br>

        당신은 침실로 도망쳐 안전을 확보했지만, 상처 없이 빠져나오지는 못했다. <<beastescape>>
        <br><br>

        <<endevent>>
        <<loadNPC 0 "hotel_dog">>
        <<clearNPC "hotel_dog">>
        "Bad dog!" says the <<person1>><<person>>. You hear a thud, then a whine, then the bedroom door opens. "Sorry about that," <<he>> says. "Here's your pay, and a little extra for the trouble." You make <<income 2500 "hotelCleaning">>.
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
<<else>>
    <<beasttype>>【은는】 당신이 일하는 동안 의아한 표정으로 지켜본다. 쓰레기봉투 두어 개를 채우고 나니 방이 깨끗해졌다.
    <<endevent>>
    <<loadNPC 0 "hotel_dog">>
    <<clearNPC "hotel_dog">>
    "Thanks for the hard work," the <<person1>><<person>> says. You make <<income 1500 "hotelCleaning">>.
    <br><br>

    <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <br>
<</if>>


