    <<set _noWake to true>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "hotel">>
<<else>>
    <<if $hotel112 gte 3>>
        You are inside Room 112, it is well equipped with furniture. There's a bed, a TV, a sofa, 2 shelves, a painting on the wall, a chair and a desk. You can look at the sea from the balcony. 
        It is <<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>raining<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>snowing<<else>>a clear day<</if>> outside.
        <br><br>
        <<if $rng gte 81>>
            The controller are on the ground.
        <<elseif $rng gte 61>>
            The painting on the wall tilted.
        <<elseif $rng gte 41>>
            The chair fell off and the cushions are all around the places.
        <<elseif $rng gte 21>>
            The painting is different than yesterday.
        <<else>>
            Furnitures remain as it is.
        <</if>>
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Rest|Seaspray Hotel 112 Rest]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<elseif $hotel112 is 2>>
        You are inside Room 112. The sheets are folded away and every surface is clean, but it isn't yours. Someone at the front desk will have to be told about it sooner or later.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Tell the front desk about the room|Seaspray Hotel 112 Deal]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
        <br>
        <<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel]]>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<elseif $hotel112 is 1>>
        You are inside Room 112. The furniture are covered with white sheet, it'll take some time to clean everything.
        <br><br>

        <<link [[Clean (3:00)|Seaspray Hotel 112 Clean]]>><<set $hotel112 to 2>><<pass 180>><<housekeeping 1 400>><</link>><<ghousekeeping 400>>
        <br>
        <<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel]]>><</link>>
        <br>
    <<else>>
        <<set $hotel112 to 1>>
        You noticed there is a hotel room stating '112' that you haven't seen previously. And almost too hidden that most people are missing it. You tried the door knob and found out the room didn't locked.
        <br><br>
        You opened the door and peer inside. Most of the furniture are covered up with white sheet, seems it's not in use for quite some time.
        <<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
            <span class='lewd'>A lewd idea strikes you.</span> You could utilise this abandoned room for personal purpose.
        <</if>>
        <br><br>
        <span class="gold">You've discovered Room 112.</span>
        <br><br>
        <<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
<</if>>


:: Seaspray Hotel 112 Rest
<<effects>>
<<set _passage to 'Seaspray Hotel 112 Bed'>>
<<set $wardrobe_location to 'officeBuilding'>>
<<set $storeLocation to 'Seaspray Hotel Bed'>>

You turned on the TV and chilled on the sofa while looking at the social media. Enjoying this rare, quiet time.
<br><br>

<<if Time.dayState is 'night'>>
	When looking out, streets are bustling with crowds. Nightlife is rich here.
<<elseif Time.dayState is 'day'>>
	When looking out, the beach is filled with tourists. And seems like there are festivals and concerts ongoing afar.
<<elseif Time.dayState is 'dawn'>>
	When looking out, people are preparing to start their day. Streets are slowly filling up with vehicles.
<<elseif Time.dayState is 'dusk'>>
	When looking out, the beach is still crowded with tourists.
<</if>>
<br><br>		

<<bedicon>><<link [[Strip and get in bed|Seaspray Hotel 112 Bed]]>><<undressSleep 'Seaspray Hotel Bed'>><</link>>
<br>
<<wardrobeSelection true>>
<<if $earSlime.alwaysSleepNaked is false>>
        <<set _bed to Furniture.get('bed')>>
        <<if _bed is undefined or _bed is null>>
            <<set _bed to Furniture.get('bed','bed')>>
        <</if>>
        <<furnitureicon _bed.iconFile>>
        <<capture _index>>
            <<link [['Wear current outfit and climb in bed'|_passage]]>><<saveTempHairStyle>><</link>>
        <</capture>>
        <br>
<<else>>
    <<if $possessed>>
        <span class='red'>The <<slimeWord>> in your head is silent.</span>
        <br>
    <<else>>
        <span class='red'>The <<slimeWord>> is not allowing you to sleep with anything on.</span>
        <br>
    <</if>>
<</if>>
<<wearoutfit>>
<br>
<<roomoptions>>
<br>
<<bathroomicon 'shower'>><<link [[Bathroom (0:01)|Seaspray Hotel 112 Bathroom]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mirroricon>><<link [[Mirror|Seaspray Hotel 112 Mirror]]>><<preMirror>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<ind>><<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel 112]]>><</link>>


:: Seaspray Hotel 112 Bed
<<nightmareCheck 'Seaspray Hotel 112 Bed Sleep'>>
<<generateSleepLinks 'Seaspray Hotel 112 Bed Sleep'>>
<<link [[Climb out of bed|Seaspray Hotel 112]]>><<storeon 'Seaspray Hotel Bed'>><<set $wardrobe_location to 'officeBuilding'>><<loadTempHairStyle>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Seaspray Hotel 112 Bed Sleep
<<set _autosavehere to true>>
<<sleep>>
<<if _dreaming>>
	/* <<earSlimeFocusChoice>> or similar widgets are running */
<<else>>
	<<effects>>
	<<wakingEffects $sleepHoursTotal>>
	<<if $rng lte 20>>
		Something gropes your butt in the night, but there's no one else in the room.<<stress 6>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
		<<nightmareWake>>
	<<else>>
		<<if ($specialClothesEffects.bimbo.total gte random(100,1000) || $specialClothesEffects.pimp.total gte random(100,1000)) or $arousal gte ($arousalmax / 10) * 9>>
			<<wetDream>>
		<<elseif !_wakingEffect>>
			당신은 깊이 잠든다.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<sleepeffects>>

	<<set $wardrobe_location to 'officeBuilding'>>
	<<wardrobeSelection true>>
	<<radiooutfits>>

	<br><br>
	<<link [[Get up|Seaspray Hotel 112 Rest]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<</if>>


