:: Seaspray Hotel Front Desk Intro 2
<<effects>>

"Ah," <<he>> says, standing up. "We're short on cleaners. We got rid of the previous one for... reasons."
<br><br>
"We'll need to assess you before hiring. Please come this way. I'll be the one assessing you," <<he>> says, showing you to a room.
<br><br>

<<if $housekeeping gte 100>>
    <<set $hotelJob to 1>><<set $hotelHired to Time.days>>
    You enter the bathroom. It's quite clean already, but the bath is stained. There are several bottles on the shelf, along with a rag. The rag is almost clean as well. You turn the bottles, but find they're completely unmarked. You try to open the closest. The lid is stuck, but you use the rag for extra purchase, and manage to twist it off.
    <br><br>
    욕조 표면에 세척액을 붓고, 화학 약품이 스며드는 동안 선반과 창턱의 먼지를 닦아낸다. 수돗물을 틀고 샤워기를 사용해 에나멜 표면을 씻어 내린다. 화학 약품이 씻겨 내려가며 진주빛 흰색이 드러난다.
    <br><br>
    The <<person>> walks in as you finish up. <span class="green">"Not bad. You're hired."</span> <<He>> looks over your work. "We'll pay you for each room you clean, so do a good job. And don't knock on any door with a lotus-shaped knob. Bad people stay in those rooms."
    <br><br>
    <i>You can now work as a cleaner in the hotel on Mer Street.</i>
    <br><br>
<<else>>
    You enter the bathroom. It's quite clean already, but the bath is stained. There are several bottles on the shelf, along with a rag. The rag is almost clean as well. You turn the bottles, but find they're completely unmarked. You try to open one, but the lid is stuck. You have more luck with the next, but you've no idea if it's what you need.
    <br><br>
    욕조에 용액을 붓고 몇 분 기다린 뒤 물을 튼다. 물은 맑아지지만 얼룩은 그대로 남아 있다. 차례대로 병을 시도해 보지만 얼룩은 전혀 지워지지 않는다. 걸레로 욕조를 박박 문질러 보아도 소용이 없다. 이제 병이 하나밖에 남지 않는다.
