                앞쪽에서 목소리가 들린다. <<covered>> 당신은 몸을 돌리지만, 그 방향에서도 목소리가 들려온다. <span class="pink">당신은 갇혔다.</span>
                <br><br>

                한쪽에는 잠기지 않은 창문이 있고, 오른쪽에는 문이 두 개 있다. 문이 잠겨 있는지는 확실하지 않다.
                <br><br>
                <<link [[Try a door|Seaspray Hotel Exposed Door]]>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Climb out the window|Seaspray Hotel Exposed Window]]>><</link>>
                <br>

            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_exposed_2" 1>>
                열려 있는 문 앞을 지나게 된다. 안에서 음악 소리, 사람들의 목소리와 움직이는 기척이 들린다. 모퉁이 너머로 살짝 엿본다. 파티가 열린 것 같다. 아무에게도 들키지 않고 지나가기는 어렵겠지만, 재빨리 지나간다면 사람들이 뭔가 잘못 본 것이라 여길지도 모른다.
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Dash by|Seaspray Hotel Exposed Dash]]>><</link>><<difficulty 50>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Find a way around (0:05)|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<stress 6>><<pass 5>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>><<gstress>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_exposed_3" 1>>
                앞쪽 계단에서 누군가 내려오는 발소리가 들려, 당신은 꼼짝없이 노출될 위기에 처한다. 당신은 몸을 숨기기 위해 커다란 화분 뒤에 웅크린다.
                <br><br>

                <<generate1>><<person1>>
                <<person>>【이가】 이쪽으로 걸어오는 모습이 보인다. 화분 뒤에 웅크리고 있으면 이상해 보일 것이다.
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Stay crouched|Seaspray Hotel Exposed Crouch]]>><</link>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Pick up the plant and walk with it|Seaspray Hotel Exposed Pick]]>><</link>><<difficulty 40>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>
        <<else>>
            <<addinlineevent "hotel_1" 1>>
                <<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<generatey3>><<person1>>
                <<person>>, <<person2>><<person>>, 그리고 <<person3>><<person>>【이가】 모퉁이를 돈다. 학교에서 본 적이 있는 얼굴들이다. 불량학생들이다.
                <br><br>
                <<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
                    <<if $whitneyromance is 1>>
                        <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신 앞을 가로막는다. "휘트니네 <<girl>>【이가】 이 근처에서 뭘 하는 거지?" <<he>>【이가】 묻는다.
                        <<if random(1, 2) is 2>>
                            <<He>> pauses, considering, <span class="pink">then shoves you against the wall.</span>. "It doesn't matter. You're in our territory. Get on your knees."<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<gpain>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<pain 4>>
                            <br><br>

                            <<link [[Get on your knees|Seaspray Hotel Events Knees]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
                            <br>
                            <<link [[Scream|Seaspray Hotel Events Scream]]>><<pain 4>><</link>><<gpain>>
                            <br>
                            <<link [[Fight|Seaspray Hotel Events Fight]]>><<def 1>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
                            <br>
                        <<else>>
                            <<he>>【은는】 잠시 멈춰 서서 생각하더니, <span class="teal">이내 옆으로 비켜선다.</span>
                            <br><br>

                            그들은 당신이 걸어가는 것을 지켜본다.
                            <br><br>

                            <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
                            <br>
                        <</if>>
                    <<else>>
                        <<person1>><<person>>【이가】 당신 앞을 가로막는다. "너 같은 놈이 이 근처에서 뭘 하는 거지?" <<he>>【이가】 묻더니, 당신을 벽으로 밀친다. <<his>> 무리들이 다가온다. "무릎 꿇어."<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<gpain>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<pain 4>>
                        <br><br>

                        <<link [[Get on your knees|Seaspray Hotel Events Knees]]>><<sub 1>><</link>>
                        <br>
                        <<link [[Scream|Seaspray Hotel Events Scream]]>><<pain 4>><</link>><<gpain>>
                        <br>
                        <<link [[Fight|Seaspray Hotel Events Fight]]>><<def 1>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
                        <br>
                    <</if>>
                <<else>>
                    The <<person1>><<person>> pulls a funny face, but they otherwise don't bother you.
                    <br><br>

                    <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
                    <br>
                <</if>>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_dog" 1>>
                <<beastNEWinit 1 "dog">>
                <<generate2>><<person2>>
                A <<beasttype 0>> walks by, followed by a <<person2>><<person>> holding a lead. <<bHe 0>> stops to sniff you, but the <<person>> jerks <<bhim 0>> away.
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_3" 1>>
                <<generate1>><<person1>>
                A <<person>> accosts you halfway in a stairwell, placing one arm around your waist, gripping your wrist with the other, and pulling you against <<him>>. "What a cute <<girl>>," <<he>> says, shifting your weight to keep you unsteady. <<He>> leans in to kiss.<<gtrauma>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>>
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Slap|Seaspray Hotel Events Slap]]>><<def 1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 1 16000>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Stomp on foot|Seaspray Hotel Events Stomp]]>><<def 1>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 5000 13000>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Endure|Seaspray Hotel Events Endure]]>><<trauma 6>><<stress 6>><<sub 1>><</link>><<difficulty 50>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<gtrauma>><<gstress>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_4" 1>>
                <<generate1>><<person1>>
                You pass a <<person>> working as a janitor. <<Hes>> wearing headphones, and doesn't seem to notice you.
                <br><br>
                <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<if $hotel112 is undefined>>
                <<addinlineevent "hotel_pair" 0.6>>
                    The front door of one of the rooms is ajar, and a purple light glows within. You smell a strange incense.<<garousal>><<arousal 600>><<set $hallucinogen += 10>>
                    <br><br>
                    <<link [[Investigate|Seaspray Hotel 112]]>><<set $hallucinogen += 10>><</link>>
                    <br>
                    <<link [[Ignore|Seaspray Hotel]]>><</link>>
                    <br>
                <</addinlineevent>>
            <</if>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_6" 1>>
                <<generate1>><<person1>>
                A <<person>> leers openly as <<he>> walks by, turning <<his>> head to look behind <<him>>.
                <br><br>

                <<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
                    <i>Charging less will make <<him>> easier to convince.</i>
                    <br><br>
                    <<link [[Solicit for £50|Seaspray Hotel Events Solicit]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
                    <br>
                    <<link [[Solicit for £100|Seaspray Hotel Events Solicit]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
                    <br>
                    <<link [[Solicit for £150|Seaspray Hotel Events Solicit]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
                    <br>
                <<else>>
                    <span class="blue">You're not promiscuous enough to take advantage.</span>
                    <br><br>
                <</if>>
                <<link [[Ignore|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_7" 1>>
                <<generatey1>><<generatey2>><<person1>>
                A <<person>> and <<person2>><<person>> chat under a stairwell. They lower their voices as you walk by.
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_8" 1>>
                You hear shouting from one of the rooms, but it doesn't sound like anyone's in danger.
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_9" 1>>
                <<dancedifficulty 1 200 true>>
                <<if $danceSuccess>>
                    You skid on a wet floor, spin, <span class="green">but manage to keep your footing.</span>
                    <br><br>

                    <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                    <br>
                <<else>>
                    You skid on a wet floor, <span class="red">and lose your footing.</span> You land on your <<bottom>>.<<gpain>><<pain 4>><<gstress>><<stress 6>>
                    <br><br>

                    <<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
                    <br>
                <</if>>
            <</addinlineevent>>

            <<addinlineevent "hotel_10" 1>>
                A <<generate1>><<person1>><<person>> seems to be following you.
                <br><br>

                <<link [[Ignore|Seaspray Hotel Events Ignore]]>><</link>><<difficulty 90>>
                <br>
                <<link [[Run|Seaspray Hotel Events Run]]>><<stress 6>><</link>><<gstress>>
                <br>
            <</addinlineevent>>
        <</if>>

        <<runeventpool>>
	<<else>>
        <<if Time.dayState is "night">>
            <<dooricon>><<link [[Approach one of the rooms (0:01)|Seaspray Hotel Lock]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
            <br>
        <<elseif $exposed lt 1>>
            <<if $hotelJob is undefined>>
                <<dooricon>><<link [[Approach the front desk (0:01)|Seaspray Hotel Front Desk Intro]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <<else>>
                <<dooricon>><<link [[Knock on a door (0:01)|Seaspray Hotel Knock]]>><<pass 1>><<set $hotelShifts to ($hotelShifts or 0) + 1>><</link>>
                <br>
            <</if>>
        <</if>>
        <<if $hotelRent and $hotelRent.arrears gt 0>>
            <<dooricon>><span class="blue">You can't use Room 112 until you've settled up with the front desk.</span>
            <br>
        <<elseif $hotel112 gte 1>>
            <<dooricon "open">><<link [[Room 112 (0:01)|Seaspray Hotel 112]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
            <br>
            <<if $hotel112 gte 3 and $exposed lt 1 and hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
                <<brothelicon>><<link [[Look for a client (1:00)|Seaspray Hotel Client]]>><<pass 60>><</link>><<promiscuous3>>
                <br>
            <</if>>
        <<elseif $exposed lt 1>>
            <<dooricon "open">><<link [[Room 112 (0:20)|Seaspray Hotel 112]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<if $hotelManager gte 1>>
            <<if Time.dayState is "day">>
                <<if $exposed lt 1>>
                    <<schoolicon "headdesk">><<link [[Manager's office (0:01)|Seaspray Hotel Manager]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
                    <br>
                <</if>>
            <<else>>
                <<ind>><span class="blue">The manager's office is closed for the night.</span>
                <br>
            <</if>>
        <</if>>
        <br>
        <<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Mer Street]]>><</link>>
        <br>
    <</if>>
<</if>>
<<set $eventskip to 0>>
